ause we  and they the the teammates the coaches  they interpret every word the guy says  and they're looking for that slight  remember when peyton manning said i'm  trying to be a good teammate here but we  have issues in protection right and  everybody lost their minds right that  was nothing compared to the things  rogers has said over the past few years  well i i don't know you know again why  well tell me what he said that's so so  much worse i've heard plenty of press  conferences where tom brady has talked  about man we got to play better you know  the offense didn't play good so we just  too many mistakes things like that you  know why is that any different than what  aaron rodgers just said right there i  don't i don't understand that you know  again i've heard a lot of quarterbacks  say that i just think we no we're we  think it's weird because mike mccarthy's  been fired and we knew there was issues  there but i think a lot of quarterbacks  make comments like that through the year  every year that quote don't like their  their performances  i can't imagine i want to go back to  2016. i can't imagine tom brady ever  saying publicly there isn't enough  energy on the sidelines and i can't  imagine him ever saying that there needs  to be a healthy fear in the locker room  that if you don't do your job you're not  going to have a job i can't imagine tom  brady saying that in a thousand years i  guess and i can't imagine bill belichick  acting like mike mccarthy so i  understand that's what happens sometimes  when the when you have bill belichick  you don't have to do some of the things  that aaron rodgers has and now i don't  mean i'm not being a jerk on tom brady  he's the man we got to go to commercial  but i just get sick of this crap with  aaron rodgers at times too i think it's  out of both both both sides of our mouth  hi i'm mike tarico and thanks for  watching make sure to hit subscribe for  the latest news and highlights from nbc  sports
 

